<title>DENMARK: Moeller orders ships in Taiwan.</title>
<headline>Moeller orders ships in Taiwan.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping, oil and gas group A.P.Moeller said on Tuesday it had reached agreement on an order with Taiwan's China Shipbuilding Corporation to build six container feeder vessels.</p>
<p>Moeller said the vessels' total capacity would be about 1,100 TEUs and that the ships would be used within its Maersk Line's global network to replace chartered tonnage when delivered during 1998.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
